    {
      "subId": "7080203",
      "subQuestName": "Go to the Adventurers' Guild",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "708020201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "708020201": {
            "id": "708020201",
            "speakerId": 1409,
            "speakerName": "Cyrus",
            "text": "In this area, huh... Are you sure, Pallad?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708020202"
            ]
          },
          "708020202": {
            "id": "708020202",
            "speakerId": 1577,
            "speakerName": "Reckless Pallad",
            "text": "I'm very sure, Mr. Cyrus.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708020203"
            ]
          },
          "708020203": {
            "id": "708020203",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Discussing Joel's dad?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708020204"
            ]
          },
          "708020204": {
            "id": "708020204",
            "speakerId": 1409,
            "speakerName": "Cyrus",
            "text": "Ah, if it isn't the Traveler! Joel sent you, I'll wager.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708020205"
            ]
          },
          "708020205": {
            "id": "708020205",
            "speakerId": 1409,
            "speakerName": "Cyrus",
            "text": "That child has asked someone to come ask us for news practically every day...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708020206"
            ]
          },
          "708020206": {
            "id": "708020206",
            "speakerId": 1409,
            "speakerName": "Cyrus",
            "text": "This time, though... We've got some good news for him, haha!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708020207"
            ]
          },
          "708020207": {
            "id": "708020207",
            "speakerId": 1409,
            "speakerName": "Cyrus",
            "text": "Previously, we were organizing some special training on Dragonspine...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708020208"
            ]
          },
          "708020208": {
            "id": "708020208",
            "speakerId": 1577,
            "speakerName": "Reckless Pallad",
            "text": "It might be best if I explained the rest, Mr. Cyrus.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708020209"
            ]
          },
          "708020209": {
            "id": "708020209",
            "speakerId": 1577,
            "speakerName": "Reckless Pallad",
            "text": "So, while taking part in that training, I wound up straying from the arranged path due to a huge blizzard.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708020210"
            ]
          },
          "708020210": {
            "id": "708020210",
            "speakerId": 1577,
            "speakerName": "Reckless Pallad",
            "text": "As I was groping my way back on track, I saw a blurred silhouette on a cliff.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708020211"
            ]
          },
          "708020211": {
            "id": "708020211",
            "speakerId": 1577,
            "speakerName": "Reckless Pallad",
            "text": "I thought that this must be a lost adventurer, just like myself, so I yelled for their attention.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708020212"
            ]
          },
          "708020212": {
            "id": "708020212",
            "speakerId": 1577,
            "speakerName": "Reckless Pallad",
            "text": "Unfortunately, before I could attract that person's attention... My cries attracted some monsters first.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708020213"
            ]
          },
          "708020213": {
            "id": "708020213",
            "speakerId": 1577,
            "speakerName": "Reckless Pallad",
            "text": "Now I don't know about you, but I wasn't confident that I could take them on in such conditions, so I beat a hasty retreat.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708020214"
            ]
          },
          "708020214": {
            "id": "708020214",
            "speakerId": 1577,
            "speakerName": "Reckless Pallad",
            "text": "Once I got back, I related the matter to Mr. Cyrus.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708020216"
            ]
          },
          "708020216": {
            "id": "708020216",
            "speakerId": 1409,
            "speakerName": "Cyrus",
            "text": "We're not sure ourselves.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708020218"
            ]
          },
          "708020218": {
            "id": "708020218",
            "speakerId": 1409,
            "speakerName": "Cyrus",
            "text": "Regardless, at least now we know that *someone* is trapped on Dragonspine. As such, I believe a rescue is in order.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708020219"
            ]
          },
          "708020219": {
            "id": "708020219",
            "speakerId": 1409,
            "speakerName": "Cyrus",
            "text": "Whether that person is Joel's father Joserf or not... Now that is up to fortune.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708020220"
            ]
          },
          "708020220": {
            "id": "708020220",
            "speakerId": 1409,
            "speakerName": "Cyrus",
            "text": "Either way, I've already dispatched all with the capability to explore Dragonspine to fan out and search.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708020221"
            ]
          },
          "708020221": {
            "id": "708020221",
            "speakerId": 1577,
            "speakerName": "Reckless Pallad",
            "text": "I'll get ready as well."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7080204",
      "subQuestName": "Go to Dragonspine and look for clues",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "708020401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "708020401": {
            "id": "708020401",
            "speakerId": 1409,
            "speakerName": "Cyrus",
            "text": "Ah, Traveler, you've returned!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708020403",
              "708020405"
            ]
          },
          "708020403": {
            "id": "708020403",
            "speakerId": 1409,
            "speakerName": "Cyrus",
            "text": "Has he now? Hah! I knew he always had a responsible bone in him somewhere...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708020406"
            ]
          },
          "708020406": {
            "id": "708020406",
            "speakerId": 1409,
            "speakerName": "Cyrus",
            "text": "Once I've finished the matters I have on hand, I'll go to Dragonspine to check on that boy Joel myself and give him the news.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708020407"
            ]
          },
          "708020407": {
            "id": "708020407",
            "speakerId": 1409,
            "speakerName": "Cyrus",
            "text": "So if you would, please tell him that I'll be right with him shortly.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708020408"
            ]
          },
          "708020408": {
            "id": "708020408",
            "speakerId": 1409,
            "speakerName": "Cyrus",
            "text": "It will take a moment for me to finish my work. Don't keep the lad waiting, now!"
          },
          "708020405": {
            "id": "708020405",
            "speakerId": 1409,
            "speakerName": "Cyrus",
            "text": "...Well, there's no guarantee, of course. I can only say that we'll do all we can."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7080205",
      "subQuestName": "Defeat all opponents",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "708020501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "708020501": {
            "id": "708020501",
            "speakerId": 1668,
            "speakerName": "Joel",
            "text": "Hey there! What's the latest news?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708020502"
            ]
          },
          "708020502": {
            "id": "708020502",
            "speakerId": 1668,
            "speakerName": "Joel",
            "text": "Oh... So Uncle Cyrus hasn't found my dad yet, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708020505"
            ]
          },
          "708020505": {
            "id": "708020505",
            "speakerId": 1668,
            "speakerName": "Joel",
            "text": "I know... I'll ask Uncle Cyrus for more details when he gets here, then. Thanks a bunch!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "708020506"
            ]
          },
          "708020506": {
            "id": "708020506",
            "speakerId": 1668,
            "speakerName": "Joel",
            "text": "Where are you, Daddy..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7080206",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Pallad",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
